   "Khaled",
   "Yes, I did. I went to my grandfather's village by the sea."
  ],
  [
   "Salem",
   "Great! What did you do there?"
  ],
  [
   "Khaled",
   "I went swimming every morning. And I went fishing with my cousin. It was fun!"
  ],
  [
   "Amal",
   "Did you go away in the holidays, Sara?"
  ],
  [
   "Sara",
   "No, I didn't. Mariam and I stayed at home."
  ],
  [
   "Amal",
   "Oh! So what did you do?"
  ],
  [
   "Sara",
   "Lots of things! I saw my friends every day. And I made some clothes for my little sister."
  ],
  [
   "Amal",
   "And you, Mariam? What did you do?"
  ],
  [
   "Mariam",
   "Not very much. I got up late every day, and I read lots of books. Oh, and I learned to cook!"
  ]
